  "title": "Henry Schein Orthodontics Launches smartIPR™ Through Exclusive U.S. Distribution Agreement with Eversmile",
  "summary": "Oscillating System Brings a Controlled Approach to Interproximal Reduction Designed to Enhance Precision and Patient Comfort MELVILLE, N.Y., June 26, 2026 Henry Schein Orthodontics (HSO), the orthodontics business of Henry Schein, Inc. (Nasdaq: HSIC), has entered into an exclusive distribution agreement with Eversmile for smartIPR(tm)an advanced Interproximal Reduction (IPR) system. Now available through HSO in the United States, smartIPR(tm) helps modernize and simplify IPR",
